diff --git a/KIO-FORK.md b/KIO-FORK.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6912fe0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/KIO-FORK.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# KIO Launcher
+
+Full source fork of [ArtCraft Launcher v0.4.1](https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher/tree/cbae640688c5fa3daa120a7f5e050f8e24148a47), copyright its original authors, licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. Original legal files and credits are retained. KIO branding does not imply upstream endorsement.
+
+The original Rust desktop and WASM applications, installation, verified download, local mirror, launch, tray, update and removal implementations are retained. The production registry is https://kio-library.vercel.app/downloads/native-apps-manifest.json. Only exact per-app KIO release tags and names from qptywoei777-rgb/kio-native-apps are accepted, with SHA256 and byte sizes. No releases/latest fallback is used. Studio is private and excluded. Installation and launching remain explicit user actions.
+
+The Mac bundle must have the exact com.kio.<app> identity and upstream numeric version, pass codesign --verify --deep --strict, and match the official registry hash/size. When KIO_MACOS_TEAM_ID is set at build time its team is required; otherwise valid ad-hoc signatures are accepted after those checks. Platform numeric-only versions are supplemented by a launcher-owned KIO revision record bound to the installed path and numeric upstream version.
+
+KIO replacement artwork is supplied by the product owner. Upstream trademark artwork under docs/brand is removed from this fork; its separate license notice is retained. Original machine binary/crate names stay unchanged for full upstream build compatibility.
